764
00:59:54,240 --> 00:59:56,196
Ah, what a pity.

765
00:59:56,480 --> 00:59:58,436
What a pity.

766
00:59:58,600 --> 01:00:02,912
So, Princess, you thought you could
outwit the imperious force of...

